  ('Druid','Circle of Beasts','Druid subclass, chosen at level 3. Features: Combat Shape (3); Primal Strike (6); Elemental Shape (10); Hybrid Form (14); Apex Predator (18); Mythic Chimera Shape (24); Thousand Forms (28).'),
  ('Druid','Circle of Seasons','Druid subclass, chosen at level 3. Features: Seasonal Boon (3); Weather Call (6); Sudden Season (10); Storm Shape (14); Year''s Cycle (18); Mythic Equinox (24); Eternal Season (28).'),
  ('Berserker','Frenzy','Berserker subclass, chosen at level 3. Features: Frenzy (3); Mindless Rage (6); Retaliation (10); Improved Frenzy (14); Relentless Assault (18); Mythic Blur of Blades (24); Storm of Slaughter (28).'),
