  ('Pugilist',1,'Unarmed Combat','Your unarmed strikes and knuckles deal your unarmed die (d6 at 1) + DEX or STR modifier. When you make an unarmed or knuckle attack as part of the Attack action, you can make one unarmed strike as a bonus action.','feature','new',NULL,1),
