  ('Summoner',1,'Cantrips','Learn 2 Summoner cantrips.','choice','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',1,'Spellcasting','You cast Summoner spells with CHA as a half caster rounded up (slots from level 1, top tier 6th), built around summoning and binding. Any spell you cast with Summoner slots is a "Summoner spell".','feature','approved','2026-09-25',2),
  ('Summoner',1,'Prepared Spells','Prepare CHA modifier + ⌈Summoner level ÷ 2⌉ Summoner spells after each long rest (minimum 1).','resource','new',NULL,3),
  ('Summoner',1,'Pact Call / Lesser Binding','During a short or long rest, a 1-minute ritual binds summons up to your binding capacity (lesser = 1 point, greater = 2). Summons act right after you on your initiative, obey you, and last until your next long rest, 0 HP, or dismissal. Their attacks use your spell attack bonus and any save they force uses your spell DC.','feature','new',NULL,4),
  ('Summoner',1,'Bound Spirit (Lesser Template)','Small spirit. AC 12 + PB. HP 10 (4 × Summoner level from 3). Speed 30 ft, fly 30 ft (hover). STR 8, DEX 14, CON 12, INT 6, WIS 12, CHA 8; DEX and WIS saves add your PB. Darkvision 60 ft. Immune to charmed (and frightened from 20). Bound Strike: melee spell attack, reach 5 ft, 1d8 force (1d10 at 11, 2d8 at 21; +PB from 3). Your subclass replaces this template at 3.','resource','new',NULL,5),
  ('Summoner',2,'Bond Link','Action: share one summon''s senses until you end it (you''re blind and deaf to your own meanwhile). Bonus action: command all your summons; uncommanded summons Dodge.','feature','new',NULL,1),
