  ('Summoner',5,'Twin Call / Greater Binding','Binding capacity becomes 2 points (max 1 greater): two lesser summons, or one greater. Twin Call: as an action, bind up to your capacity mid-combat without the ritual; 1 use per rest (2 at 13).','feature','new',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',5,'Greater Bound Spirit (Greater Template)','Large spirit. AC 13 + PB. HP 8 × Summoner level. Speed 30 ft, fly 30 ft (hover). STR 16, DEX 12, CON 16, INT 8, WIS 12, CHA 10; CON and WIS saves add your PB. Greater Strike: melee spell attack, reach 10 ft, 2d8 + PB force (2d10 at 11, 3d10 at 21); from 11 it makes two Greater Strikes.','resource','new',NULL,2),
  ('Summoner',6,'Subclass feature','Gain your subclass''s level 6 feature.','feature','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',7,'Protective Bond','Reaction when you or a summon within 30 ft is targeted by an attack: swap places with the summon, or shield it (+2 AC against that attack).','choice','new',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',8,'Ability Boost','Raise your ability scores (amount in the Shared Frame); no score can go above 20.','boost','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',9,'Spell Tier Up','You gain 3rd-tier slots.','resource','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',10,'Subclass feature','Gain your subclass''s level 10 feature.','feature','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',11,'Commander''s Strike','Once per turn, when you cast a Summoner spell, one of your summons can use its reaction to make one attack.','feature','new',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',12,'Ability Boost','Raise your ability scores (amount in the Shared Frame); no score can go above 20.','boost','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',13,'Twin Call (2)','Twin Call: 2 uses per rest.','resource','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',14,'Subclass feature','Gain your subclass''s level 14 feature.','feature','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',15,'Unbreakable Tether','Once per long rest (2 at 27), when a summon drops to 0 HP, it stays at 1 HP instead. This is the Summoner''s one cheat-death feature (it protects summons, not you).','feature','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',16,'Ability Boost','Raise your ability scores (amount in the Shared Frame); no score can go above 20.','boost','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',17,'Legion','Binding capacity becomes 3 points (max 1 greater).','resource','new',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',18,'Subclass feature','Gain your subclass''s level 18 feature.','feature','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',19,'Ability Boost','Raise your ability scores (amount in the Shared Frame); no score can go above 22.','boost','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',20,'Lich','You earn the level 20 title Lich.','title','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',20,'Lich Benefits','You have advantage on concentration saves, your summons can''t be frightened, binding capacity becomes 4 points, and once per long rest you can resummon all bound entities as an action.','feature','new',NULL,2),
  ('Summoner',21,'Always Accompanied','You begin each day with a summon already active.','feature','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',22,'Ability Boost','Raise your ability scores (amount in the Shared Frame); no score can go above 24.','boost','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',23,'Commander''s Strike Every Turn','Commander''s Strike works every turn, not only when you cast.','feature','canon',NULL,1),
  ('Summoner',24,'Subclass feature','Gain your subclass''s level 24 (mythic) feature.','feature','canon',NULL,1),
